> f(x: u8) = x >> 2
> g(x: u8) = (x >> 2) + (x == 17 ? 1 : 0)
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 1 point, e.g. x=17: 4 vs 5
> equiv g f
g and f differ at 1 point, e.g. x=17: 5 vs 4
